SUMMARY:Daniel Donato's Cosmic Country
LOCATION:Royale\, 279 Tremont St\, Boston\, MA 02116
DESCRIPTION:There are a lot of musical influences and sources that Daniel D
 onato has drawn on during his career and that inform his latest album\, Ho
 rizon (Retrace Music)\, his second all-original album. But within those\, 
 Donato has carved out a unique and individualized spot for himself\, one t
 hat speaks to the deep American music heritage that inspires him — and t
 hat he’s pushing towards the future with inspired\, intentional vigor.\n
